# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data that must never be committed.
#
# Stream footage, frames, crops and card artwork belong to their rights holders
# (tournament organisers, broadcasters, Riot Games). Datasets live in a private
# bucket and are referenced here only by manifest (sha256 per file) -- see
# docs/research/04-data-and-evaluation.md. If you are about to force-add one of
# these, stop and ask in an issue first.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
datasets/
data/
frames/
crops/
vods/
catalog-cache/
card-art/
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.mov
*.flv
*.webm
*.avi
*.m3u8
*.m4s
*.aac
*.wav
*.mp3

# Model weights ship as release assets, not in git history.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.ort
*.tflite
*.engine
*.bin
runs/
wandb/
mlruns/

# Python
